{
  "version": "style-blacklist-v1",
  "status": "provisional",
  "note": "Template phrases that read as machine copy. Initial list for P0-4e; the real word list is decision D7. Matching is literal substring, case-insensitive for Latin text. \"patterns\" are structural templates matched by regex (shown to the model by their \"show\" form); \"summary_markers\" are research-summary set-ups.",
